\n- **Four-fifths of them are his lines**.\n  - Sean's lines from the second scene = $ \\frac{4}{5} \\times 60 = 48 $\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Total lines Sean has to memorize\n\nAdd up all the lines:\n\n- **Solo song**: 54  \n- **First scene**: 36  \n- **Second scene**: 48  \n\n$$\n\\text{Total lines} = 54 + 36 + 48 = \\boxed{138}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n$$\n\\boxed{138}\n$$ lines.", "decode_seconds": 9.49466976383701, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 119, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "97d91717d4d9074be3a3b860039fabe039870d688f7300648cc419a68806c183", "output_tokens": 359, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20526951424, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20879245312, "problem_id": "gsm8k/a9798075c6e641a8", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 9529.278013855219}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "138", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 9.529278013855219, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20879245312, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20879245312, "sampling_seed": 1830359572277660469, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 359, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03320860397070646, "turn_index": 0}
